                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Kaede, an ordinary high school girl, wakes up in a strange world and finds a book she doesn't recognize. The book says that she can make a potion by simply gathering the ingredients and chanting \"create.\"",
                        "jpn": "見覚えのない異世界で目を覚ました普通の女子高生・カエデの元には見覚えのない本が。そこには材料を揃えて「生成」と唱えるだけでポーションが作れると書いてあり――"
                    },
