                        "eng": "Mysterious Bag",
                        "jpn": "ふしぎなカバン"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Kaede has successfully secured food and lodging by selling the potions she created. While searching for a bag large enough to hold more potions, she comes across an especially expensive bag...!?",
                        "jpn": "生成したポーションを売って、食事と宿を確保することに成功したカエデ。大量のポーションを作るため、もっと入るカバンを探しているとひときわ高いカバンがあり……!?"
                    },
